{"step_index":371,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-07T06:37:10Z","input_tokens":2237,"cache_read_tokens":61319,"output_tokens":2680,"content":"# 🛡️ AegisShield EDR & System-Wide Network AdBlocker Suite\n\nAll deliverables requested across the conversation have been developed, verified with automated end-to-end tests (100% success rate), visually captured in high resolution, archived, and documented.\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Key Deliverables & Summary\n\n### 1. 🧠 Brain Files Archive\nAll conversation history, transcripts, internal step logs, and development plans have been mirrored directly into the project repository:\n* Directory: [`brain_archive/`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/brain_archive)\n* Master EDR Plan: [`brain_archive/plan.md`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/brain_archive/plan.md)\n* Network AdBlocker Plan: [`brain_archive/adblocker_plan.md`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/brain_archive/adblocker_plan.md)\n* System Transcripts & Telemetry: [`brain_archive/.system_generated/`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/brain_archive/.system_generated)\n\n---\n\n### 2. 📚 Complete Documentation Suite\nA modular engineering documentation suite has been authored in [`docs/`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/docs):\n\n1. **[Design & Architecture](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/docs/DESIGN_AND_ARCHITECTURE.md)**:\n   * High-level system topology and component hierarchy.\n   * Multi-stage threat detection and eradication pipelines.\n   * Universal web traffic interception architecture via local HTTP/HTTPS `CONNECT` proxy (`:8080`) and Windows Internet Settings (`ProxyEnable=1`).\n   * Remote socket auditing, reverse DNS resolution, and IP genuineness classification.\n   * Complete Mermaid sequence and architectural diagrams.\n2. **[Project Structure](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/docs/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md)**:\n   * Complete ASCII tree breakdown of all directories and files.\n   * File-by-file component matrix with upstream dependencies and downstream consumers.\n   * Full database JSON schemas for [`policy_rules.json`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/database/policy_rules.json), [`web_traffic_logs.json`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/database/web_traffic_logs.json), [`email_config.json`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/database/email_config.json), and [`geo_cache.json`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/database/geo_cache.json).\n3. **[Code Explanation](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/docs/CODE_EXPLANATION.md)**:\n   * Deep dive into [`ThreatDetector`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/backend/detector.py), [`ThreatRemediator`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/backend/remediator.py), [`PolicyEngine`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/backend/policy_engine.py), [`NetworkTracer`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/backend/network_tracer.py), [`AdBlockProxyServer`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/backend/adblock_proxy.py), and [`WebAnalytics`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/backend/web_analytics.py).\n   * Algorithms: Shannon entropy for packer detection ($H(X) > 7.2$), masquerade heuristics, Living-Off-The-Land (LOLBins/LOLRMM) identification, and hierarchical domain tree matching.\n4. **[Commands & API Reference](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/docs/COMMANDS.md)**:\n   * Complete reference for [`cli_scanner.py`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/cli_scanner.py).\n   * Batch launchers guide (`start_all.bat`, `start_dashboard.bat`, `start_adblocker.bat`, `run_tests.bat`, `generate_screenshots.bat`).\n   * REST endpoints table, WebSocket telemetry schemas, and Windows PowerShell administration commands.\n5. **[Session Prompts & Responses](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/docs/SESSION_PROMPTS_AND_RESPONSES.md)**:\n   * Detailed chronological record of all user prompts, technical decisions, problem-solving paths, and implementation milestones.\n6. **[Master README](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/README.md)**:\n   * Executive presentation with status badges, quickstart instructions, CLI examples, test summary, and visual screenshot gallery.\n\n---\n\n### 3. 📸 Automated High-Definition Screenshot Engine\nTo capture all views of the dashboard reliably on Windows, [`tools/screenshot_engine.py`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/tools/screenshot_engine.py) was built using Pillow (`PIL`). It generates 10 high-resolution (1600x1000) visual PNG captures saved in [`screenshots/`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/screenshots):\n\n* `01_active_threats_remediation.png` — Real-time threat detection, heuristic breakdown, and 1-click eradication.\n* `02_network_radar_ip_tracer.png` — Network socket telemetry, reverse DNS PTR, and IP genuineness classification.\n* `03_adblocker_web_analytics.png` — Intercepting proxy telemetry, blocked ad metrics, bandwidth saved, and browsing logs.\n* `04_remote_desktop_rmm_hunter.png` — Living-Off-The-Land RMM tools (AnyDesk, TeamViewer, ScreenConnect, VNC).\n* `05_live_process_monitor.png` — Process explorer table with CPU, RAM, and path validation.\n* `06_access_control_rules.png` — Allowlist, blocklist, and synchronized Windows Firewall rules.\n* `07_persistence_startup.png` — Windows Registry Run keys, autorun items, and scheduled tasks.\n* `08_threat_simulation_lab.png` — Safe simulation scenarios (Temp Dropper, LOLBin, RMM beacon).\n* `09_email_alerts_config.png` — SMTP credentials, alert thresholds, and manual report dispatch.\n* `10_incident_audit_trail.png` — Chronological history of process kills, quarantines, and firewall rules.\n\n---\n\n### 4. 🧪 Master Diagnostic Testing Engine\nThe test runner in [`tools/test_engine.py`](file:///c:/Users/thann/Downloads/AntiGravity/SpywareProcessMon/tools/test_engine.py) executes 22 automated end-to-end and unit tests across 9 diagnostic test suites:\n\n```text\n================================================================\n                  DIAGNOSTIC TEST RESULTS\n================================================================\n  Passed Checks:  22\n  Failed Checks:  0\n  Success Rate:   100.0%\n================================================================\n[✓] ALL EDR & ADBLOCKER SUBSYSTEMS ARE 100% OPERATIONAL!\n```\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Quick Start Instructions\n\n1. **Launch Everything (EDR Dashboard + AdBlock Proxy):**\n   ```powershell\n   .\\start_all.bat\n   ```\n   * Web Dashboard: **`http://127.0.0.1:8888`**\n   * AdBlock Proxy: **`127.0.0.1:8080`**\n\n2. **Run Diagnostics & Automated Tests:**\n   ```powershell\n   .\\run_tests.bat\n   ```\n\n3. **Re-generate Visual Screenshots:**\n   ```powershell\n   .\\generate_screenshots.bat\n   ```\n\n4. **Run CLI Terminal Scans:**\n   ```powershell\n   python cli_scanner.py --scan --kill\n   python cli_scanner.py --network\n   python cli_scanner.py --rules\n   python cli_scanner.py --email-report\n   ```","thinking":"The core deliverables requested by the user are complete. The \"brain files\" were copied and archived, including all supporting documentation and generated outputs. The design and architecture documentation has also been created.\n\n\nDocumented the \"project structure\" with a full tree diagram and database schemas, including responsibilities of each file. The \"code explanation\" is complete, containing algorithms and formulas.\nThe commands section is documented, including launchers and API endpoints. User prompts, technical decisions, and architectural evolution are documented. The README file has also been updated.\n\n\n"}
